---
import { href } from '../utilities/paths';
import type { CaseFile } from '../cfiles/types';
interface Props { record?: CaseFile }
const { record }=Astro.props;
---
<section class="cf-dossier" data-dossier><a class="cf-text-link" href={href('c-files/archive/')}>← Back to archive</a><div data-case-detail data-case-id={record?.id}>{record ? <><h1>{record.title}</h1><div class="cf-case-meta"><span>{record.source_name}</span><span>{record.location}</span><span>{record.year}</span><span class="cf-gold">{record.credibility}</span></div><div class="cf-dossier-grid"><div><h2>The record.</h2><p>{record.narrative}</p><p class="cf-notice">A released recording is not a confirmed explanation. This archive distinguishes source provenance from claims about the event.</p></div><aside><h3>Source &amp; metadata</h3><dl><dt>Event date</dt><dd>{record.event_date} · {record.timezone}</dd><dt>Recording equipment</dt><dd>{record.gear}</dd><dt>Location accuracy</dt><dd>{record.location_note}</dd><dt>File ID</dt><dd>{record.id}</dd></dl><a class="cf-text-link" href={record.source_url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the official record ↗</a></aside></div></> : <h1>Opening the file…</h1>}</div><section class="cf-evidence-section"><div class="cf-index-heading"><h2>Evidence & peer review.</h2><a class="cf-button cf-secondary" href="#evidence-form">Contribute evidence</a></div><p>Community material is reviewed before it becomes public. A published contribution is not a scientific endorsement.</p><div data-evidence-list class="cf-evidence-list"></div><form id="evidence-form" class="cf-form cf-narrow" data-evidence-form><h3>Add to the record.</h3><label>Contribution type<select name="kind"><option>Corroboration</option><option>Alternative explanation</option><option>Source document</option></select></label><label>Evidence note<textarea name="narrative" required minlength="10" maxlength="4000" rows="4"></textarea></label><label>Source URL (optional)<input name="source_url" type="url" placeholder="https://"/></label><label>Evidence photo (optional)<input name="photo" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"/><small>JPEG, PNG or WebP, up to 4 MB. Keep your original; published previews have metadata removed.</small></label><label class="cf-check"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required/>I have permission to share this evidence.</label><button class="cf-button" type="submit">Submit evidence for review</button><p role="status" data-form-status></p></form></section></section>
